    "date": "1986-10-17",
    "date_note": "Date given as '17.10.1986 Kajaani' in the murha.info front-page compilation 'KUN LAPSI TAPPAA! - alaikaisten tekemia henkirikoksia Suomessa', quoted by Doctor Lecter (p=761975). The thread title and opening post only said 1986 / mid-1980s.",
    "status": "solved",
    "outcome": "Punishment for murder committed as a young person was demanded in court and the boy was ordered to undergo a mental state examination, but the thread's own sources say the sentence is not known; forum posters claim he has remained in involuntary psychiatric care (Niuvanniemi, Kuopio) ever since.",
